    "runtime": "Flux development desktop, CLI help, registered verbs and full MCP tools/list; fluxplot 0.4.0 for plotted examples; the separate development image writer for the scientific image bundle.",
    "notes": "Verified all five scientific drawing hashes and the part explorer SVG and tree against fresh fluxplot outputs. Executed the published first-project Python source, composed its semantic plot into a figure, restyled the named series, inspected its data and exported it through the CLI. Used synthetic arrays to check Python image writing, recipes, label-table attachment, shared placement, per-placement views and native SVG export. Desktop stills, video encodes, figure exports and native player examples have individual capture and data provenance in the media manifests. The installation page identifies the public releases separately."
  }
